{
  "name": "loader-bundle-env",
  "private": true,
  "dependenciesComments": {
    "@plasmicapp/auth-api": "The @plasmicapp/* entries that were only transitive deps under yarn are declared directly since the pnpm migration: wab's loader bundler resolves generated code's bare imports through this package's node_modules, and pnpm only exposes direct deps at its top level (yarn hoisted everything). See wab/src/wab/server/loader/module-writer.ts and tools/internal/test-docker-structure.sh.",
    "@ant-design/pro-components": "Must be 2.6.4. Earlier doesn't support newer antd, later incurs a disallowed dynamic require of antd/es/layout/Sider. https://app.shortcut.com/plasmic/story/37043/richlayout-always-initially-loads-with-dark-background",
    "rc-util": "Must be ^5.44.4. Earlier versions doesn't support React 19+ by attempting to use findDOMNode from react-dom. https://linear.app/plasmic/issue/PLA-11800/investigate-issue-with-rich-components-table-in-react-19"
  },
